{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"提摩太前书","commonName":"提摩太前书","title":"提摩太前书","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"1283a295c0ef7e56f757ad6e7e76c1668be08ddb2a26a8cc24ad7c4d20c6e4fd","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["下面这句话值得我们相信：“如果有人希望成为长者，这也是可以做的善行。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["一个长者必须无可指摘，只娶一名妻子，有节制，保持平衡、庄重、款待他人、善于教导。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他应该不好酒、不暴力，而是要温和，与人无争或者不贪财，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他必须能管好自己的家，他让儿女做的事情，儿女必须敬重顺服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["（因为一个男人如果不知如何管好自己的家，怎能管理上帝的教会？）"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他不应该是一个新加入的信徒，否则他可能会骄傲",{"noteId":9},"，这就落入与魔鬼相同的惩罚之中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他在教会以外也应有个好名声，这样他就不会被人毁谤，从而落在魔鬼的陷阱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["同样，执事",{"noteId":10},"也必须庄重、不伪善、不酗酒、不骗取不义之财。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他们必须用纯粹的良心信上帝，坚持显示关于上帝真想。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他们首先应去尝试一段时间，如果没有错误，然后才让他们担任执事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他们的妻子",{"noteId":11},"也要庄重，不应用闲话中伤他人，应该有节制，所做的一切都应该值得信任。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["执事只应娶一个妻子，善于管理儿女和自己的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["那些表现优秀的执事，为自己赢得好名声，也因相信基督耶稣而获得更多自信。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["尽管希望尽快见到你，我仍把这些写给你，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["万一我拖延了，你也可以知道人们在上帝的家中应该做出怎样的行为。这是永生上帝的教会、真理的柱石和根基。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["关于上帝所显现的真相真惊人，这一点毫无疑问。他以人的形态让我们知道他，灵是他的证明，天使看到他，向各国宣布，世界相信他，他为此获得荣耀。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"或“他以无知为荣。”","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":6}},{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"“执事”一词直接源自希腊​词“diakonos”，意思是仆人。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":8}},{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"“他们的妻子”：或简称为“女人。”","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TI/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TI/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TI/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}